  "cue_count": 56,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 2.61,
      "end": 6.73,
      "text": "So, is the number of unauthorized immigrants living in the U.S. declining?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.155869,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 6.73,
      "end": 11.45,
      "text": "The short answer is yes, the number of unauthorized immigrants living in the U.S. has dropped",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.155869,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 11.45,
      "end": 14.33,
      "text": "to its lowest level in more than a decade.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.155869,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 14.33,
      "end": 18.61,
      "text": "Before we dive in, it's important to note that when we talk about unauthorized immigrants,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.155869,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 18.61,
      "end": 23.93,
      "text": "we mostly mean immigrants who either cross the border without permission or violate the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.155869,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 23.93,
      "end": 29.53,
      "text": "terms of their admission by staying past their visa expiration date or using false documents.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.155869,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 29.53,
      "end": 31.53,
      "text": "Now on to the data.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.155869,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001549
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 31.53,
      "end": 36.05,
      "text": "The Pew Research Center's latest estimate shows that there were a total of 10.5 million",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.164129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000856
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 36.05,
      "end": 39.97,
      "text": "unauthorized immigrants living in the U.S. in 2017.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.164129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000856
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 39.97,
      "end": 45.65,
      "text": "That number is down by 1.7 million or about 15% from its peak in 2007.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.164129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000856
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 45.65,
      "end": 49.77,
      "text": "You're probably wondering how we arrive at this estimate and what else we're able to",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.164129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000856
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 49.77,
      "end": 51.13,
      "text": "learn from this number.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.164129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000856
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 51.13,
      "end": 55.85,
      "text": "To get us started, here's senior demographer Jeff Pacell, who's been our lead researcher",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.164129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000856
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 55.85,
      "end": 59.37,
      "text": "responsible for these estimates since 2005.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.164129,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000856
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 59.37,
      "end": 64.45,
      "text": "At the Pew Research Center, we use official government data sources to estimate how many",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117692,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.044678
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 64.45,
      "end": 68.13,
      "text": "people can be categorized as unauthorized immigrants.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117692,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.044678
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 68.13,
      "end": 74.57,
      "text": "First, we use U.S. Census Bureau data, like the 3.5 million household American Community",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117692,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.044678
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 74.57,
      "end": 80.93,
      "text": "Survey, to determine the total number of immigrants living in the country in a specific year.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117692,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.044678
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 80.93,
      "end": 86.65,
      "text": "Then, we calculate how many legal immigrants live in the United States using government",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117692,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.044678
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 86.65,
      "end": 93.69,
      "text": "data on the number of legally admitted immigrants, refugees, and people granted asylum.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.122965,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003172
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 93.69,
      "end": 98.69,
      "text": "We update the estimate of legal immigrants with data on death rates in the U.S. and",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.122965,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003172
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 98.69,
      "end": 100.81,
      "text": "migrants leaving the country.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.122965,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003172
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 100.81,
      "end": 106.37,
      "text": "Next, this number of legal immigrants gets subtracted from the total immigrants in the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.122965,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003172
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 106.37,
      "end": 111.93,
      "text": "country to arrive at our initial estimate of how many unauthorized immigrants live in",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.122965,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003172
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 111.93,
      "end": 114.09,
      "text": "the U.S. in a given year.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.122965,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003172
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 114.41,
      "end": 116.53,
      "text": "But we don't stop there.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 116.53,
      "end": 121.53,
      "text": "Based on experience and research, we know census data and other surveys tend to miss",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 121.53,
      "end": 122.53,
      "text": "some people.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 122.53,
      "end": 128.89,
      "text": "So, we use sources like the Census Bureau's studies of undercounts and Mexican government",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 128.89,
      "end": 133.25,
      "text": "data to further verify and adjust our estimate.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 133.25,
      "end": 139.01,
      "text": "Only then are we confident that our number is as accurate as possible.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 139.01,
      "end": 140.01,
      "text": "Thanks, Jeff.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 140.01,
      "end": 142.69,
      "text": "So, once we determine an estimate, what's next?",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203434,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000261
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 142.69,
      "end": 146.93,
      "text": "Well, we're then able to discover key trends and characteristics of the unauthorized immigrant",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 146.93,
      "end": 147.93,
      "text": "population.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 147.93,
      "end": 152.89,
      "text": "For example, Mexicans have long made up the largest share of unauthorized immigrants,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 152.89,
      "end": 153.89,
      "text": "and they still do.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 153.89,
      "end": 158.33,
      "text": "But the number of Mexicans living in the U.S. without authorization has been falling since",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 158.33,
      "end": 159.33,
      "text": "2007.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 159.33,
      "end": 164.05,
      "text": "And this is a part of a wider trend, in which we've seen a large drop in the number of",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 164.05,
      "end": 168.13,
      "text": "new unauthorized immigrants not just from Mexico, but in general.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 168.13,
      "end": 172.09,
      "text": "With fewer new unauthorized immigrants, we find that those who are in the country are",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.005379
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 172.09,
      "end": 175.93,
      "text": "more and more likely to have lived in the U.S. for a long time.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 175.93,
      "end": 180.57,
      "text": "For example, we estimate that about two-thirds of adults have lived in the country for more",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 180.57,
      "end": 182.29,
      "text": "than 10 years.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 182.29,
      "end": 186.85,
      "text": "While the number of Mexicans entering the U.S. has gone down, the U.S.-Mexico border",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 186.85,
      "end": 191.73,
      "text": "remains a pathway for entry by growing numbers of unauthorized immigrants from El Salvador,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 191.73,
      "end": 194.13,
      "text": "Guatemala, and Honduras.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 194.13,
      "end": 198.33,
      "text": "In our latest estimate, Central America was the only region besides Asia, accounting",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 198.33,
      "end": 202.01,
      "text": "for more U.S. unauthorized immigrants than in 2007.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.145335,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002544
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 202.13,
      "end": 207.17,
      "text": "As you can see, counting the number of unauthorized immigrants within the country presents some",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203125,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002623
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 207.17,
      "end": 212.97,
      "text": "challenges, but it's incredibly important to carefully weigh multiple sources of reliable",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203125,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002623
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 212.97,
      "end": 216.85,
      "text": "data to develop and verify the final estimate.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203125,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002623
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 216.85,
      "end": 219.69,
      "text": "Doing so produces more than a single number.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203125,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002623
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 219.69,
      "end": 224.49,
      "text": "It provides a look at who is entering and staying in the U.S., enriching the public",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203125,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.002623
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 224.49,
      "end": 227.29,
      "text": "dialogue and supporting sound decision-making.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.203125,
